@* The content of a Modal shown through the service, with a Modal of its own declared inside it - the
   confirmation a form asks for from the middle of itself. The inner one is a Modal in its own right: what
   the container cascades belongs to the Modal that is rendering this content, and the inner one starts from
   nothing but what it declares. *@
<BitModal @bind-IsOpen="IsInnerOpen" Class="inner-modal">
    <div class="inner-content">Inner</div>
</BitModal>

@code {
    [Parameter] public bool IsInnerOpen { get; set; } = true;
}
